@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> UserSuggestionRequest

state UserSuggestionRequest
state UserIdentification
state GatherSuggestedVideos
state AddVideoDetails
state SendSuggestions

UserSuggestionRequest : entry / Receive suggestion request
UserSuggestionRequest --> UserIdentification : requestVideoSuggestion

UserIdentification : entry / Identify user
UserIdentification --> GatherSuggestedVideos : identifyUserCompleted

GatherSuggestedVideos : entry / Gather based on profile
GatherSuggestedVideos --> AddVideoDetails : gatherComplete

AddVideoDetails : entry / Add thumbnails and view counts
AddVideoDetails --> SendSuggestions : addDetailsComplete

SendSuggestions : entry / Send to user
SendSuggestions --> [*]

@enduml
